{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415661","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415661","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041566101:1":{"text":"そこをどいてちょうだい。","source_cn":"……让开，生者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70D272C39F9EFC90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041566102:1":{"text":"あら？その冷たい肌、生命力を感じない身体……","source_cn":"哦？这冰凉的肌肤，毫无生命力蕴藏的躯体……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BD365770BBD2E7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041566103:1":{"text":"聞いたことがありますよ。美しい子よ、あなたはグレイヴボーンですね？","source_cn":"我曾经听闻过外界相关的传闻，美丽的孩子，你就是亡灵吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3399239CCACD16E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041566104:1":{"text":"分かったなら、そこをどいて。","source_cn":"你现在知道了，让开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD71D0AB7B019E7F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041566105:0":{"text":"偉大なる女王陛下から、あなた方に関する話を教えていただいたことがあります。","source_cn":"亡灵的传闻，还是伟大的女王陛下为我等讲述的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09ECC2340FEE869F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041566106:1":{"text":"あの時、まだ子どもだったサリエ殿は、ずいぶんと失礼な質問をしたものですわ。","source_cn":"沙利叶那孩子当时还提了一个失礼的问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB618334D9AFC9FD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041566107:1":{"text":"「グレイヴボーンにとって、自分を殺した相手は、憎むべき仇か？それとも親のような存在か？」","source_cn":"——“对亡灵来说，杀死他们的是仇人，还是造就他们的父母呢？”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FD8B5AEE1B2278E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041566108:1":{"text":"……それ以上言ったら、容赦しないわよ。","source_cn":"……你再说一句，我就不客气了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7447AE701FBA180","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041566109:1":{"text":"ふふ、その美しい瞳の奥に興味深い輝きが見えますね。","source_cn":"我在你的眼中看到了一些有趣的光芒，美丽的孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89A776CD76794C9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041566110:1":{"text":"つまり、あなたには命を与えてくれた者がいて、あなたはその人に感謝し、依存している。違いますか？","source_cn":"所以，你有着为你赋予生命的长者，你是如此感激又依赖着对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E96A4BDBAD4B756","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041566111:1":{"text":"ええそうよ。けれど、それが忠誠というものよ。","source_cn":"我有，但我认为那是基本的忠诚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E062DF7DE996581","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041566112:1":{"text":"もちろんですとも。ですが、その感情はただの忠誠を越えているのでは？","source_cn":"那当然是忠诚，孩子，但我认为，那感情更胜于朴素的忠义或...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76A353354CC59FA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041566113:1":{"text":"そう、私はそれを――「信仰」と呼んでいます。","source_cn":"我愿意称之为——信仰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC542A3029891454D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041566114:1":{"text":"……時間の無駄ね。結局、ただの気が触れた狂信者じゃない。","source_cn":"……真是浪费时间，说到底还是个疯了的神棍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE89DD8A75C524245","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041566115:1":{"text":"あなたもいずれ分かりますよ。","source_cn":"你会明白的，孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7FAF7D2B29F0D07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041566116:1":{"text":"「忠誠」を越えた向こうにあるのは、「敬虔」なのですから。","source_cn":"能够超越忠诚的，只有虔诚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x329B429126C55AE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:波妮":{"text":"ボニー","source":"波妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奎茵":{"text":"エイン","source":"奎茵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":2}}